{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02600","headline":"奉和月夜观星应令 · 虞世南","name":"奉和月夜观星应令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早秋炎景暮，初弦月彩新。\n清风涤暑气，零露净嚣尘。\n薄雾销轻縠，鲜云卷夕鳞。\n休光灼前曜，瑞彩接重轮。\n缘情摛圣藻，并作命徐陈。\n宿草诚渝滥，吹嘘偶搢绅。\n天文岂易述，徒知仰北辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}